        "analysis": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "The flux-weighted average cross-section of the",
              " reaction 181Ta(g,n)180mTa was evaluated using the",
              " subtraction of experimentally determined",
              " cross-section of the reaction 181Ta(g,n)180gTa from",
              " the experimental cross-section of reaction",
              " 181Ta(g,n)180m+gTa estimated using experimental",
              " cross-section of reaction 181Ta(g,n)180Ta, equations",
              " (1) and (2) of article."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "comment": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "Owing to the different thresholds of the",
              " 65Cu(g,n)64Cu and natTa(g,n)180gTa reactions the",
              " photon flux obtained from the 65Cu(g,n)64Cu reaction",
              " was modified using a conversion factor, which",
              " incorporated the value of the threshold energy of",
              " each studied reaction."
